# Words that place a fraction between "the" and the ordinal: "the last third
# of the month".  "third" as a fraction: Wiktionary, "third", noun sense 2,
# "One of three equal parts of a whole."  Each word's placing sense, from
# Wiktionary, adjective sense number, then its definition:
#   final     1    "Last; ultimate."
#   middle    1    "Located in the middle; in between."
#   last      1    "Final, ultimate, coming after all others of its kind."
final
middle
last
